## Model card (verified specs — benchmark section below is empty by design)

- **Name:** Fledge Alpha (Free preview tier)
- **Short description:** Free-tier preview reasoning model on OpenCode Zen, live since 2026-10-01. Provider not publicly attributed — treated as a Zen preview alias (listed on the Zen models endpoint but not yet on the Zen docs pricing/provider tables).
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen only, `opencode/fledge-alpha-free` (`https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions`). No base `fledge-alpha` paid ID and no other vendor endpoint found as of research date.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-10-01 per models.dev metadata ("operator-supplied"). Knowledge cutoff unknown.
- **IDs:** `fledge-alpha-free` on Zen. No Hugging Face/OpenRouter listing found.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens total, up to 131,072 output (models.dev `fledge-alpha-free.toml`; input/output/reasoning tokens share the budget).
- **Modalities:** Text + image in, text out; tool calls supported; reasoning with `reasoning_effort` low / high / max (OpenCode route mapping, models.dev).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-02):** $0 on Zen (free-tier preview). Not yet on the Zen docs free-models list, so time limits/data policy are undocumented — flag until the docs page catches up.
- **Architecture:** Not disclosed; open_weights = false.

